<title>USA: Osmonics authorizes 1.5 mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>Osmonics authorizes 1.5 mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osmonics Inc said Monday its board authorized management to buy up to 1.5 million of the company's 14.2 million outstanding shares over an unspecified period.</p>
<p>Osmonics manufactures water purification and fluid filtration, separation and handling equipment.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
